        <mxCell id="note" value="Careful trace from the photo (see ../photos/2026-07-31-original-wiring-diagram.PNG), pass 2.&#10;Room ADJACENCY and SHAPE follow the photo closely. Wall lengths/angles are still NOT real-world scaled -- the source is an unscaled hand sketch photographed at an angle.&#10;Circuit numbers shown are as legible on the original; legend text only clearly covers 1-9 -- numbers above 9 (10, 13, 14, 15, 17, 18, 19, 20) appear on the diagram but their legend descriptions were off-photo/illegible." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=12;fontColor=#990000;" vertex="1" parent="1">
